<title>USA: US spot MTBE down, contago shows effects of cuts.</title>
<headline>US spot MTBE down, contago shows effects of cuts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spot MTBE prices were steady to lower in thin trade this week as many players sat on the sidelines amid volatility on NYMEX gasoline futures, traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>But the out months appeared slightly higher, partly due to the expected impact on the market by shutdowns this month at several Gulf Coast plants, players said.</p>
